    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d158-a2">

                <pb facs="0270" n="190" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg190"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Baron Komura to Mr. Buck.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of Foreign Affairs</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Tokio</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-03-06"><hi rendition="#italic">March 6,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 7.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Monsieur le Ministre</hi>: I have the honor to
                    acknowledge the receipt of your excellency’s note of March 3 on the subject of
                    the restoration of Tientsin and its suburbs to Chinese administration.</p>
                <p>In reply I beg to state that the Imperial Government fully shares the views of
                    the United States Government that the abolition of the provisional government at
                    Tientsin at the earliest date is highly desirable in various respects, without
                    affecting in any way the question of the presence of the foreign detachments for
                    the purpose of maintaining free communication between Peking and the sea.
                    Consequently the Imperial Government will have no objection whatever to its
                    abolition, provided that all the other powers actually participating in the
                    provisional government agree to the same.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Baron Komura</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
